    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Automatic catchweigher operating as an automatic weight or weight/price labeller (Category Y); designated CWL-700 when configured to operate only as an automatic checkweigher (Category X). Comprises a self-indicating and price-computing weighing machine with associated thermal label printer and mechanical handling facilities, designed to weigh packs statically at a constant rate of operation. Provided with: initial zero-setting device, semi-automatic zero-setting device, automatic zero-setting after time interval or number of packs, zero-tracking device, preset tare device, semi-automatic (subtractive) tare device, zero indication; calibration not accessible to user; price computation."
